# Everything is LF, whatever machine it was checked out on. The repo is started on
# Windows and developed through WSL, and a shell script or a shebang line with a
# carriage return in it fails on Linux in ways that do not look like a line-ending
# problem.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact copies of files Windows DiscWright wrote. autorun.inf is CRLF on
# purpose, and a test compares it byte for byte, so git must never touch it.
tests/fixtures/** -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.iso binary
